+The main Conversation supports two Session panes. Dragging a Session from the Workspace browser to a side opens or focuses it; each pane retains its own Session binding. The focused pane owns main navigation, and the layout keeps its pane order, focus, and width across reloads. Each pane stays within the panel height and scrolls its history independently, keeping its composer in the visible scrollport. Narrow layouts show only the focused pane while retaining the split.
